note as BIZ_diagram_04_directory
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  Models each client organization and its sites, and keeps every
  organization's data strictly isolated. Supports anything from a single
  independent doctor to multi-site hospital networks, diagnostic units,
  pharmacies, insurers, brokers and external authorities. Specialized entities
  keep their own tenant/data boundary even when hosted at another site.
end note

